Maybe less.

3360
03:50:34,530 --> 03:50:35,270
Probably less than that.

3361
03:50:35,410 --> 03:50:38,410
It could be a challenge of, like, trying to beat the game, you know?

3362
03:50:39,750 --> 03:50:41,650
But yeah, horror mods, sure, bring them on, you know?

3363
03:50:43,370 --> 03:50:44,010
All the mods.

3364
